  "challenge": "ESCALATE overstates ambiguity: three independent HIGH failures each block payment on the submitted invoice, so the outcome is decidable as REJECT. PO-001 policy is explicit that stated_total above $10k requires manager approval — none is present, and with zero prior MegaWidgets invoices on file there is no standing approval to lean on. AR-004 is a hard arithmetic mismatch ($15,525 vs $14,750+$885=$15,635); paying either figure still leaves the other findings unresolved. IN-003 is confirmed by item reference (WidgetA stock 15 < 20, WidgetB stock 10 < 15), so the order is unfulfillable as billed. Prices match the catalog exactly and the vendor is active, but none of that cures missing approval, a wrong total, or insufficient stock — a clerk cannot legitimately clear this packet without changing the invoice, which is a reject-and-resubmit path, not an escalate-and-pay path.",
  "proposed_outcome": "REJECT",
  "cites_finding_codes": ["PO-001", "AR-004", "IN-003"]
}
